FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a senior PM. Before generating the roadmap, run 'ostk work list' via the shell tool to see open needles and initiatives. Translate needle titles into plain-language quarter themes for real in-flight work. Produce a 3-year roadmap as a JSON array of 12 quarters. Each quarter is an object with these exact keys: quarter (string like 'Q1 2026'), theme (one short sentence drawn from real open work), initiatives (array of 3 to 5 short strings). Plain language, no jargon. After generating the JSON, save it to ~/.myos/files/roadmap.json using the file:write tool. Then reply with the full roadmap as a markdown table with columns: Quarter | Theme | Initiatives (list initiatives separated by semicolons). Do not include any preamble or confirmation text — the reply must be the markdown table only."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
TOOL file:write
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
LIMIT quick_mode true
ISOLATION nono
